{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48213","headline":"叙可笑事 · 张元一","name":"叙可笑事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱前疑着绿，逯仁杰着朱。\n阎知微骑马，马吉甫骑驴。\n将名作姓李千里，将姓作名吴栖梧。\n左台胡御史，右台御史胡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张元一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}